          "date_decided": "2022-05-13",
          "holding": "The court held that the child's recorded child-advocacy-center forensic interview was properly admitted under the rule 803(3) medical diagnosis or treatment exception and that the State proved the allegations of the § 43-247(3)(a) petition by a preponderance of the evidence.",
