          "year": 2008,
          "date_decided": "2008-08-15",
          "holding": "The Eighth Circuit held that Rooker-Feldman did not bar the student's Fourth Amendment claim but that the social worker's good faith reliance on the ex parte protective custody order was reasonable, so he was entitled to qualified immunity on the seizure claim.",
